commit fc40e76ad4c60bb43c9a78a643749a3b45f11c90
Author: Usty <usty@uase.tech>
Date:   Sun Aug 2 13:40:30 2026 +0000

    fix(ios): correct viewport-fit, safe-area insets, and footer jump on iPhone Dynamic Island devices
    
    - Add viewport-fit=cover so env(safe-area-inset-*) actually resolves on iOS
    - Add safe-area CSS vars + overscroll-behavior-y:none to stop iOS rubber-band bounce
    - Switch FeedFooter from position:sticky to position:fixed to match the stable
      UserBottomNav/dashboard nav pattern, add safe-area padding + GPU layer promotion
    - Add padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top) to every topbar (User/Dealer/Staff/
      Partner/Admin + car detail page) so content clears the Dynamic Island/notch
    - Add safe-area padding to Dealer/Staff sidebars and floating messages widget
    - Reserve bottom padding on feed page content so it isn't hidden behind the
      now-fixed footer

